<headline>TABLE - Marsh &amp; McLennan Q2 shr $0.87.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			   1996</p>
<p> Shr(a)(b)	 $	 0.87	   $	 0.79</p>
<p> Net			145,000		  115,200</p>
<p> Revs		   1,449,800		1,036,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs(a)	    167,000		  146,000</p>
